== Icelandic ==
===Etymology===
From ''[[fara]]'' (meaning "to [[go]]") + ''[[af]]'' (meaning "[[off]]") + ''[[stað]]'', the {{dat}} {{singular}} of ''[[staður]]'' (meaning "[[place]]"). Literally meaning "to go off place".
=== Verb ===
'''[[fara#Icelandic|fara]] [[af#Icelandic|af]] [[staður|stað]]'''

# to [[depart]], to [[leave]]

